  (text "CC loop: U301A compares the DAC setpoint with the shunt voltage. Summing node INP = (SETP - I*Rshunt)/2, so the loop settles at I = SETP / 10 mOhm."
    (at 25 212.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 16f12396-0e98-43c2-a948-539f559eed58))
  (text "Setpoint: MCP4725 #1 (0x60) 0-3.3 V, divided by R301/R302 to 0-108 mV -> 0-10.8 A full scale (~2.6 mA per LSB)."
    (at 25 216.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 7f7641a7-483d-422d-9a58-25532aca4b37))
  (text "Q301 IRFP260N in linear mode on the CPU-cooler heatsink, with the external 0.1 Ohm 50 W aluminium resistor (J301) in series to share the heat."
    (at 25 221.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 4cce785d-e262-4b69-8d9c-9bd1d23d3bdc))
  (text "Kill: Q302 (LOAD_OFF from MCU, pulled up = off at boot) and Q303 (hardware FAULT) short INP to ground -> gate goes low."
    (at 25 225.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 703cdf07-0634-4bec-95a6-bbdc9d6a93e7))
  (text "Sequence: close K2 with LOAD_OFF high, release LOAD_OFF with DAC = 0, then ramp the DAC."
    (at 25 230.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 8a298cff-cd7c-46c0-965a-87a9b5d7467c))
  (text "U301B: bidirectional current monitor for the fast internal ADC and the OC comparators: I_MON = 1.65 V + 0.12 V/A (approx -13 A ... +13 A)."
    (at 25 234.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 5e8ae81c-e045-4186-9bd1-4811c53cf84c))
  (text "U301 = OPA2188 (zero-drift, 36 V, input range includes V-). Check pinout of the DAC module you buy (order varies)."
    (at 25 239.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 49778753-a787-4fc4-8545-ec4011bb53fb)))
